  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat (375°F).",
    "2. In a small bowl, mix together olive oil, lime juice, cilantro, garlic powder, salt, pepper, and red pepper flakes.",
    "3. Add the prawns to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "4. Thread the marinated prawns onto the skewers, leaving a small space between each prawn.",
    "5. Brush the grates with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "6. Grill the skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until the prawns are pink and cooked through.",
    "7. Serve immediately with vibrant chimichurri sauce (see below for recipe).",
    "8. Garnish with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
